  unitName: Compliant Subduer Mel
  unitId: 51267
  unitNumber: 1688
  description: Most would agree that, judging by Mel's past, she would have continued
    her indifferent execution of missions unchanged even in Rahnas's ideal world.
    She almost certainly would have lost the last shreds of her emotions, including
    even the fear of death. In time, her almost-mechanical movements and nature would
    have become a symbol of terror to the common people. With Mel as a symbolic deterrent
    against subversives, Rahnas's control would have been all the more secure.
  summonDesc: I don't know how my comrades feel... But if it's an order, I simply
    obey. I will join your side.
  fusionDesc: In strength itself there is value. Lord Rahnas said so... My value...depends
    on you.
  evoDesc: I exist... to achieve Lord Rahnas's goals. I do not know any other way
    to live...
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
